<div>
  <label>{{localize 'E20.ActorHealth'}}</label>
  <input class="two-digit-input no-lock" type="number" name="system.health.value" value="{{system.health.value}}" min="0" step="1" />
  <span>/</span>
  {{!-- .max is always computed now (Essence20Actor#_prepareHealth runs for every actor type) and
       editing happens exclusively through the Resources header's own gear icon (Stat Editor
       dialog), so this is plain text rather than a disabled input - a box that looks editable but
       isn't just invites the click. --}}
  <span class="sidebar-readout" data-tooltip="{{system.health.string}}">{{system.health.max}}</span>
</div>
